$0.$\n\nTo do this, we can apply the following elementary column operations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A &=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 & -24 \\\\ -1 & -1 & -7 \\\\ 8 & 9 & -9\\end{bmatrix}\n\\\\ &\\xrightarrow{C_{1}:=C_{1}-2C_{2}}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 & -24 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -7 \\\\ -10 & 9 & -9\\end{bmatrix}\n\\\\ &\\xrightarrow{C_{3}:=C_{3}+8C_{2}}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -15 \\\\ -10 & 9 & 63\\end{bmatrix}\\\\ &=B\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the elementary column operations are\n\n$C_{1}:=C_{1}-2C_{2}$ and $C_{3}:=C_{3}+8C_{2}$."] [:db/add "23d27102-fcbd-5d8d-9f38-9d26cbb6fb6b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "23d27102-fcbd-5d8d-9f38-9d26cbb6fb6b" :question/answer-fields "b5a2a1cf-019d-5be1-978f-99d2d5de03d0"] [:db/ensure "23d27102-fcbd-5d8d-9f38-9d26cbb6fb6b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186161968 :knowledge-point/questions "23d27102-fcbd-5d8d-9f38-9d26cbb6fb6b"] [:db/add "b4b4cfb6-1190-5134-bf19-9f3ba8a55cbe" :answer/id #uuid "b4b4cfb6-1190-5134-bf19-9f3ba8a55cbe"] [:db/add "b4b4cfb6-1190-5134-bf19-9f3ba8a55cbe" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "b4b4cfb6-1190-5134-bf19-9f3ba8a55cbe" :answer/value "$C_{1}:=C_{1}+3C_{3}$ and $C_{2}:=C_{2}-5C_{3}$"] [:db/ensure "b4b4cfb6-1190-5134-bf19-9f3ba8a55cbe" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e6ed73e2-e9a4-5fd3-affc-e03ef09a114b" :answer/id #uuid "e6ed73e2-e9a4-5fd3-affc-e03ef09a114b"] [:db/add "e6ed73e2-e9a4-5fd3-affc-e03ef09a114b" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "e6ed73e2-e9a4-5fd3-affc-e03ef09a114b" :answer/value "$C_{1}:=C_{1}-5C_{3}$ and $C_{2}:=C_{2}+3C_{3}$"] [:db/ensure "e6ed73e2-e9a4-5fd3-affc-e03ef09a114b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6ff8dacb-3cfd-5fb0-8f4e-1752f9fa2713" :answer/id #uuid "6ff8dacb-3cfd-5fb0-8f4e-1752f9fa2713"] [:db/add "6ff8dacb-3cfd-5fb0-8f4e-1752f9fa2713" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "6ff8dacb-3cfd-5fb0-8f4e-1752f9fa2713" :answer/value "$C_{1}:=C_{1}-3C_{3}$ and $C_{2}:=C_{2}-5C_{3}$"] [:db/ensure "6ff8dacb-3cfd-5fb0-8f4e-1752f9fa2713" :