& 5 & 6\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & -1 \\\\ -5 & 18 & 4 \\\\ -18 & 35 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nBy applying elementary column operations of the form $C_i:=C_i+kC_{3},$ the matrix $A$ can be transformed into the matrix $B.$ What are the elementary column operations?"] [:db/add "c7c550fa-a627-5c43-bc1d-dd6031afbf62" :question/worked-solution "To transform $A$ into $B,$ we need to make entries to the left of $a_{13}=-1$ equal to $0.$\n\nTo do this, we can apply the following elementary column operations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A &=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 7 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\n\\\\ &\\xrightarrow{C_{1}:=C_{1}-3C_{3}}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 5 & -1 \\\\ -5 & -2 & 4 \\\\ -18 & 5 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\n\\\\ &\\xrightarrow{C_{2}:=C_{2}+5C_{3}}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & -1 \\\\ -5 & 18 & 4 \\\\ -18 & 35 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\\\ &=B\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the elementary column operations are\n\n$C_{1}:=C_{1}-3C_{3}$ and $C_{2}:=C_{2}+5C_{3}$."] [:db/add "c7c550fa-a627-5c43-bc1d-dd6031afbf62" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "c7c550fa-a627-5c43-bc1d-dd6031afbf62" :question/answer-fields "4df64327-885c-53b0-9e1b-776c820a09f6"] [:db/ensure "c7c550fa-a627-5c43-bc1d-dd6031afbf62" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186161968 :knowledge-point/questions "c7c550fa-a627-5c43-bc1d-dd6031afbf62"] [:db/add "76e31e90-b398-5dd6-8f1c-4293e6c6eccb" :answer/id #uuid "76e31e90-b398-5dd6-8f1c-4293e6c6eccb"] [:db/add "76e31e90-b398-5dd6-8f1c-4293e6c6eccb" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "76e31e90-b398-5dd6-8f1c-4293e6c6eccb" :answer/value "$C_{1}:=C_{1}-5C_{3}$ and $C_{2}:=C_{2}+8C_{3}$"] [:db/ensure "76e31e90-b398-5dd6-8f1c-4293e6c6eccb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3cfb99d6-961e-58c2-adda-8509425df5d8" :answer/id #uuid "3cfb99d6-961e-58c2-adda-8509425df5d8"] [:db/add "3cfb99d6-961e-58c2-adda-8509425df5d8" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "3cfb99d6-961e-58c2-adda-8509425df5d8" :answer/value "$C_{1}:=C_{1}+5C_{3}$ and $C_{